WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,000
Congratulations on your marriage

2
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:02,400
Do you have any job opportunities?

3
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:03,600
I should be able to do cultural aid work

4
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:06,400
Did an online test in university professional software and passed CET-6 in design

5
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:07,800
Is it so hard to find a job?

6
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:09,600
Before I graduated, I thought it would be easy to find a job.

7
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:10,800
After experiencing some things personally

8
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:12,000
Only to find out it's not like that

9
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:13,400
Do you feel that you have graduated from a bachelor's degree?

10
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:14,600
So the requirements are too high

11
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:16,400
You can try to be a salesperson and it's easy to get hired.

12
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:18,400
I'm not very good at embellishment of products

13
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:20,400
What's the use of good grades? What's the use of a bachelor's degree?

14
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:21,800
It’s not like I can’t find a job

15
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:24,600
If you just stick to the rules, you won't be able to find a job. You have to cooperate.

16
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:28,410
I’ll order you when the time comes, Wu Haoqiang

17
00:00:28,410 --> 00:00:30,210
Will you die if you say something humane?

18
00:00:30,210 --> 00:00:31,210
What did you say?

19
00:00:31,210 --> 00:00:32,210
Wu Haoqiang

20
00:00:32,210 --> 00:00:34,210
Why haven't you changed at all in four years?

21
00:00:34,210 --> 00:00:35,610
Want me to give you your glorious century

22
00:00:35,610 --> 00:00:37,010
Can you tell me clearly?

23
00:00:39,110 --> 00:00:40,910
Maybe you can try opening your own store

24
00:00:41,310 --> 00:00:42,310
That requires funds

25
00:00:42,710 --> 00:00:44,310
The Rou family doesn't have the support of your parents like you do.

26
00:00:44,710 --> 00:00:46,310
He even gave his house to his uncle
